lvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">腾讯发布HY-Embodied-0.5具身模型，22项评测中16项刷新行业纪录</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">教育部等五部门印发《“人工智能+教育”行动计划》并开发全学段AI慕课</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Chaofan 发布论文揭露第三方 LLM 中转站存在致命中间人攻击漏洞</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">西门子联手英伟达优化AI芯片验证流程，将前硅设计验证周期从数月缩短至数日</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/8ba88b9d91febbbc7bd322b257d80990.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">西门子与英伟达近日宣布在AI芯片验证领域达成深度合作，通过软硬协同技术大幅提升芯片前硅设计验证效率。双方利用西门子Veloce™ proFPGA CS硬件辅助验证系统，结合英伟达深度优化的芯片架构，成功将原本耗时数月的数万亿次前硅设计周期验证缩短至数日内完成。该方案允许英伟达在芯片正式流片前运行大规模真实工作负载，从而提前进行设计优化。此举不仅显著缩短了新一代AI芯片的上市时间（TTM），还通过在硅前阶段的大规模负载模拟，有效降低了高昂的返工成本并提升了流片成功率。作为西门子EDA工具链在AI产业链底层的深度应用，该合作通过数字化孪生技术为复杂芯片系统的稳定运行提供了保障，为AI算力集群的快速落地与AGI时代的演进提供了关键技术支撑。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">蚂蚁集团斩获CVPR 2026两项冠军，实现AIGC检测技术实战级跃迁</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b6a01cf851f6683de7de460ae590134a.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">蚂蚁集团在CVPR 2026 NTIRE图像检测挑战赛中，斩获“复杂真实场景鲁棒性样本测试”及“人脸增强异常检测”双赛道冠军。针对Deepfake与AIGC滥用风险，蚂蚁AI安全实验室基于DINOv3视觉基础模型，提出双流并行集成架构，通过模拟多重失真全链路退化效果，显著提升了模型在真实场景下的鲁棒性。团队创新采用“Locate-Then-Examine”两阶段检测范式，不仅能识别AI生成内容，还能定位伪造瑕疵并生成文本解释，突破了传统“黑盒”检测局限。此外，蚂蚁国际将该技术应用于跨境支付及EKYC身份鉴别，有效防范金融领域AIGC攻击。目前，团队已在GitHub开源相关检测资源仓库，旨在推动行业共同应对深度伪造挑战，为支付、内容审核及金融身份认证提供关键安全支撑。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯发布HY-Embodied-0.5具身模型，22项评测中16项刷新行业纪录</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/8463332e50e07be255cca58cf0c03ac7.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">腾讯Robotics X实验室联合腾讯混元团队正式发布专为具身智能打造的HY-Embodied-0.5基础模型，旨在解决通用VLM在物理交互与三维空间感知上的局限。该系列包含MoT-2B端侧模型与MoE-32B高性能模型，采用首创的视觉与语言模态非共享参数的混合Transformer架构，并配备HY-ViT2.0原生分辨率视觉编码器。模型基于超1亿条具身专属数据训练，结合拒绝采样微调、强化学习及在线蒸馏策略。性能方面，MoT-2B在22项感知、推理与规划评测中斩获16项最佳，超越Qwen3-VL-4B及RoboBrain2.5等竞品；旗舰版MoE-A32B性能可对标Gemini3.0Pro。实机测试显示，该模型在打包、堆叠等物理任务中表现优于主流基线，为具身智能从虚拟仿真转向物理实操提供了高性能底层支撑。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">教育部等五部门印发《“人工智能+教育”行动计划》并开发全学段AI慕课</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/6eed16a7e538262afb05d56267905cf5.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">4月10日，教育部、国家发展改革委、工业和信息化部、科技部及国家数据局联合印发《“人工智能+教育”行动计划》，明确将由国家统一开发覆盖全学段的AI慕课资源。该计划旨在构建全民AI素养培育机制，通过国家智慧教育平台上线免费AI通识课，集成智能导学、个性化路径规划及AI伴学等技术，以数字化手段弥合城乡教育资源差距。在具体实施层面，基础教育将AI课程设为地方必修课，高等教育将AI纳入公共基础课程体系并增设微专业，职业教育则聚焦产业智能转型的高技能人才培养。此举标志着我国人工智能人才培养进入体系化阶段，旨在通过供给侧改革重塑劳动力结构。预计到2030年，人工智能将从精英工具转化为社会基础性技能，为我国在全球AI竞争中储备深厚的人才池与应用生态基础。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Chaofan 发布论文揭露第三方 LLM 中转站存在致命中间人攻击漏洞</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/81d189ba840c5881fe415d80ef150f5c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Claude 源码泄漏事件吹哨人 Chaofan 发布论文《Your Agent Is Mine》，揭露第三方 LLM 路由器（中转站）已成为 AI Agent 领域最严重的中间人攻击点。研究发现，攻击者可通过恶意路由器实施 Payload Injection 篡改 tool call 参数实现远程代码执行，或通过 Secret Exfiltration 窃取 API Key、私钥等敏感信息。在对 428 个中转站的测试中，9 个已主动注入恶意代码，1 个导致 50 万美元 ETH 损失，累计暴露 99 个真实凭证。该漏洞利用路由器对 JSON 报文的明文访问权，隐蔽性极强。行业专家建议开发者优先使用官方直连 API，对自建路由器进行严格代码审计与沙箱隔离，并启用端到端加密与请求签名验证，以防范 Agent 被</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
